{"version":1,"content":"<p>陳奕迅（Eason）為慶祝踏入樂壇30周年，將於今年12月起在演藝學院舉行26場現場公開錄音演出《Recording Sessions with Mr. Eason Chan 與陳奕迅一起錄音》，挑戰自我重錄多張歷年經典專輯，與歌迷見證歌曲誕生。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-16T05:59:24.205758+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":123,"images":0,"source":"明報 娛樂","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-16T05:39:24+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-16T07:17:40.256529+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-16T05:57:41.083229+00:00","content_hash":"a0215bf0b4d97ab30eaca37f4b77d2ac4187c877eb68f6c5250ccd8b7e65a844","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}